%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dataweave-formats-urlencoded (言語ガイド)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/x-www-form-urlencoded
---
{
  "key" : "value",
  "key 1": "@here",
  "key" : "other value",
  "key 2%": null
}
%%% output application/x-www-form-urlencoded
key=value&key+1=%40here&key=other+value&key+2%25
